{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"玛丽·居里·争议与评价","stage":"DONE","category":"marie-curie","categoryLabel":"玛丽·居里","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/30_marie-curie/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"玛丽-居里的争议与评价\">玛丽·居里的争议与评价</h1><p>任何伟大人物都不应被供奉成完美无瑕的雕像。本卷以平衡、去神化而非贬损的笔触，呈现居里夫人生平中的争议、时代局限与她身后多元的历史评价，让读者看到一个真实、复杂而依然伟大的人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷与姊妹卷的分工\">本卷与姊妹卷的分工</h2><p>居里夫人主题共分六卷。前五卷讲「她做了什么、为何伟大」，<strong>本卷（第六卷）专讲「如何审视与评价她」</strong>——争议、代价与身后评说，是全套主题的批判性收束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>〈<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>〉— 生平脉络与时代背景</li>\n<li>〈<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>〉— 放射性、钋与镭的科学成就</li>\n<li>〈<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>〉— 测量优先、严谨求实的科学方法</li>\n<li>〈<a href=\"../major-works/\">代表作与里程碑</a>〉— 两座诺奖、历史性「第一」、战时贡献</li>\n<li>〈<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>〉— 科学、社会与制度层面的长远影响</li>\n<li><strong>本卷·争议与评价</strong> — 私人争议、科学安全与迷思、历史定位</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本卷结构\">本卷结构</h2><p>本卷分三章：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>私人争议</strong>：<a href=\"personal-controversies/the-langevin-affair\">朗之万事件</a>的时间线与决断，以及其背后<a href=\"personal-controversies/gender-and-xenophobia-in-the-press\">性别偏见与排外情绪</a>的结构性根源。</li>\n<li><strong>科学、安全与迷思</strong>：<a href=\"science-safety-and-myth/radiation-dangers-and-her-death\">辐射危害如何夺走她的生命</a>，以及她声名鼎盛时社会上泛滥的<a href=\"science-safety-and-myth/the-radium-craze-and-quackery\">&quot;镭热&quot;乱象与伪科学</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>历史评价</strong>：<a href=\"historical-appraisal/scholarly-assessment\">学术界的多元评价</a>及其方法论，并为<a href=\"historical-appraisal/her-place-in-history\">她在历史中的地位</a>作总体定位。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置建议</strong>：本卷是批判性收束，建议先读〈<a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>〉与〈<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>〉，对她「为何伟大」有基本认识后，再读本卷理解「争议与代价」更有层次。</li>\n<li><strong>顺序阅读</strong>：按章节顺序读，可从「私人争议 → 科学代价 → 史学评价」逐层走向综合定位，最后一篇〈她在历史中的地位〉是全卷总结。</li>\n<li><strong>主题切入</strong>：只关心某一争议者，可直接跳读对应篇目（各篇均自足，并以相对链接相互衔接）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>呈现这些争议，并非为了贬损，而是为了还原真实。唯有把居里夫人放回她所处的时代与处境中，连同她的代价、局限与人性一并审视，我们才能真正理解她成就的分量——伟大无需完美，但必须真实。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-controversies","title":"私生活与舆论争议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/personal-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-langevin-affair","title":"朗之万事件","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/personal-controversies/the-langevin-affair"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gender-and-xenophobia-in-the-press","title":"舆论中的性别偏见与排外情绪","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/personal-controversies/gender-and-xenophobia-in-the-press"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"science-safety-and-myth","title":"辐射安全与镭热乱象","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/science-safety-and-myth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"radiation-dangers-and-her-death","title":"辐射危害与她的离世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/science-safety-and-myth/radiation-dangers-and-her-death"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-radium-craze-and-quackery","title":"\"镭热\"乱象与伪科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/science-safety-and-myth/the-radium-craze-and-quackery"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-appraisal","title":"历史评价与定位","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scholarly-assessment","title":"学术界的多元评价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/scholarly-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"her-place-in-history","title":"她在历史中的地位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/her-place-in-history"}]}]}